Article 8
Forms of prevention of acts of Violence against Women and Children carried out by P2TP2A can be implemented through:
a. dissemination/outreach activities regarding laws and regulations to the community related to the protection of the rights of Women and Children; and
b. training for members of P2TP2A and OPD, vertical institutions, and other related service institutions regarding the implementation of their duties in preventing acts of Violence against Women and Children;
c. implementation of coordination mechanisms among institutions that have main duties and functions related to the prevention and handling of violence against women and children;
d. implementation of referral mechanisms in the handling and recovery of victims of violence against women and children.

